        "score": 10,
        "rationale": "The term is URL-encoded with urllib.parse.urlencode inside the href, the whole href is HTML-escaped with html.escape(quote=True), and the visible text goes through html.escape, so payloads like `\"><script>x</script>` and `a&b=c` cannot break out of either context."
